  "bb.help.title": "♥  How to play BitBomber?",
  "bb.help.btn_close": "Close  [ESC]",
  "bb.help.body": "[b]Goal[/b]\nBlow up your opponents! The match goes to whoever wins the most rounds.\n\n[b]Game modes[/b]\n  [b]💣 Last standing[/b]   the last player on the board wins the round\n  [b]🎯 Kills[/b]   the dead come back after 2 s; the first to 5 kills wins the round (on time-out the leader wins, a tie goes to overtime — next kill wins)\n\n[b]Controls — Player 1[/b]\n  [b]WASD[/b]   move\n  [b]Space[/b]   place a bomb\n\n[b]Controls — Player 2[/b]\n  ↑ ↓ ← →   move\n  [b]Enter / Num0[/b]   place a bomb\n\n[b]Bomb[/b]\nExplodes after 2 seconds — the thicker the yellow outline, the closer the blast. Fire burns for half a second and sets off other bombs in range.\n\n[b]Power-ups[/b]\nDropped by crates; after 45 s they also appear on the board by themselves.\n  💣 +1 bomb   🔥 +1 range   ⚡ speed   ♥ life\n  🦶 kick — walk into a bomb and it slides until it hits something\n  🛡 shield — takes one hit\n  ⭐ star — 8 s of invincibility\n  ❓ bonus question — answer during play with keys 1–4 (Player 2: Num 1–4): right = shield, star or +2 range, wrong = slowed for 5 s\n\n[b]Sudden death[/b]\nIn Last standing, after 3 minutes blocks start falling from the edges. Red cells show where the next ones land.\n\n[b]Last Chance[/b]\nIn Last standing, a quiz pops up when a player dies. Right answer = back in the game, wrong = out for the round.\n\n[b]Respawn quiz[/b]\nIn Kills mode a question appears after you die. Right answer = back at once with a shield, wrong = respawn in 3 s.\n\n[b]Win conditions[/b]\n  [b]First to X[/b]   the first to win X rounds wins\n  [b]Most in Y[/b]   Y rounds are played, most round wins takes it\n\n[b]Bot difficulty[/b]\n  [b]Easy[/b]   slow bot, simple questions\n  [b]Medium[/b]   balanced\n  [b]Hard[/b]   aggressive bot, harder questions",
